  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Title:Multi sector Life saving Activities in Abu Jabrah &amp; Bahr Al Arab, East Darfur
 
 Nutrition has 2 outcomes.
 
 Improved access and utilisation of quality acute malnutrition treatment services 0-59mths -in 3 treatment facilities
 
 Prevention of malnutrition through behavioural change communication of nutrition impact practices programme
 
 WASH has 2 outcomes
 
 Increased availability of safe water for the community and schools for drinking and multiple uses. 10,700 people.
 
 Increased access to sanitation services. 2819 communities
 
 Child Protection has 1 outcome
 
 Girls and boys have improved access to safe CP services in 2 locations
 
 33% stake for WVUK. 80188</narrative>
  </description>
